Package: ggclusteroutline
Type: Package
Title: Outline Labelled Point Clusters in Two-Dimensional Embeddings
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Nizar", "Batada", email = "nizar.batada@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("CellStyle contributors", role = "cph"))
Description: Add tight component envelopes or locally dominant density regions
    to ggplot2 scatterplots. Compute geometry from supplied coordinates and
    cluster assignments independently of point colour. Reuse frozen paths
    across figures or cache repeated computations within an R session.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: dbscan, digest, ggplot2 (>= 3.5.0), rlang, sp, grid, stats
Suggests: Seurat, SeuratObject, testthat, Matrix
